    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "caveat_note",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Caveat (verified against real model, not just guides):\nactual SQLAlchemy model still keeps a separate\ndocument_version_status table (PK = document_version_id)\n— guides 05/06 describe the folded-in design that\n03/19 document, but code has not caught up yet.",
      "originalText": "Caveat (verified against real model, not just guides):\nactual SQLAlchemy model still keeps a separate\ndocument_version_status table (PK = document_version_id)\n— guides 05/06 describe the folded-in design that\n03/19 document, but code has not caught up yet.",
